[Music]  spinnaker for Google cloud platform is a  solution that lets you install spinnaker  the open source multi cloud application  delivery platform in Google cloud  platform with a couple of clicks to  start creating pipelines for continuous  delivery of your applications when you  open the management environment which  runs in cloud shell you can follow a set  of guided steps to install a  production-ready spinnaker instance in a  new google kubernetes engine cluster in  minutes using Google's recommended  settings you can change many of the  installation parameters if desired  including installing spinnaker in an  existing GK cluster spinnaker for Google  cloud platform also integrates your  spinnaker installation with other Google  cloud services such as cloud build  container registry and stack driver once  the installation process is complete you  can access the spinnaker UI via port  forwarding or automatically configure a  secured endpoint using cloud identity  aware proxy with the valid SSL  certificate  the management environment provides many  helpers to simplify ongoing  administration of your spinnaker  instances the configuration of each  instance is automatically and securely  backed up for auditing and fast recovery  helpers are provided to connect  spinnaker to new to K clusters and to  create accounts to deploy to Google  compute engine and Google App Engine and  other GCP projects you also have access  to the hal and spin command-line tools  giving you full control of your  spinnaker instances if needed the  solution lets you add sample pipelines  and applications to spinnaker that  demonstrate best practices for  deployments to kubernetes VMs and more  devops teams can use these as starting  points to provide golden path deployment  pipelines tailored to their company's  requirements the hello world web app  application for example demonstrates a  continuous delivery setup that builds  the application with cloud build and  deploys it first to staging and then to  production with spinnaker  once the staging deployment is completed  a manual judgment determines whether to  continue with the deployment to  production spinnaker for Google cloud  platform is pre integrated with Google  pops up for notifications and can also  be linked to slack email and other  notification channels  the deployment to production  demonstrates a number of good practices  such as automated roll back when the  validation tests fail and the hot  standby period after successful  validation in case something unexpected  happens  we can see the kubernetes resources  spinnaker is managing in the spinnaker  UI and can go straight to our deployed  app to check things out you can try out  the solution today just search for  spinnaker for Google cloud platform on  cloud or Google com

